{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-finite-completeness.md","title":"Finite Kripke completeness of GL","display":"thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","aliases":["72-thm-gl-finite-completeness"],"display":"thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]","[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","[[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]]","[[72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, Theorem 2.4 and its finite L-model construction, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-and-proof-checked","source_proof_status":"L case read and visually checked; local frame, truth-lemma and countermodel proof checked","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a84520417d5eb9a3\" href=\"?note=a84520417d5eb9a3\" title=\"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model\">72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f13b228413db1156\" href=\"?note=f13b228413db1156\" title=\"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor\">72-lem-gl-canonical-successor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"588ba1ca83000a13\" href=\"?note=588ba1ca83000a13\" title=\"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness\">72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, Theorem 2.4 and its finite L-model construction, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"L case read and visually checked; local frame, truth-lemma and countermodel proof checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f13b228413db1156\" href=\"?note=f13b228413db1156\" title=\"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor\">72-lem-gl-canonical-successor</a> 及其上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m,\\Phi_A,\\operatorname{Adeq}_m,W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi\">\\(\\mathcal F_m,\\Phi_A,\\operatorname{Adeq}_m,W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是任意有限 adequate set，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"588ba1ca83000a13\" href=\"?note=588ba1ca83000a13\" title=\"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness\">72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness</a> 及其上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m B\">\\(\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m B\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models_m B\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models_m B\\)</span>。关系仍按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(u,v)\\Leftrightarrow\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\">\\(R(u,v)\\Leftrightarrow\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\)</span> 使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi)\\ \\land\\ |W_\\Phi|\\leq2^{|\\Phi|}\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall w\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal M_\\Phi,w\\Vdash_m B\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in w\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi)\\ \\land\\ |W_\\Phi|\\leq2^{|\\Phi|}\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall w\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal M_\\Phi,w\\Vdash_m B\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in w\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\bigr)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists w\\in W_{\\Phi_A}\\;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal M_{\\Phi_A},w\\Vdash_m A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\bigr)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists w\\in W_{\\Phi_A}\\;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal M_{\\Phi_A},w\\Vdash_m A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall W\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall V\\;\\bigl(&amp;\n|W|&lt;\\omega\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\Rightarrow\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\models_m A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall W\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall V\\;\\bigl(&amp;\n|W|&lt;\\omega\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\Rightarrow\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\models_m A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\Phi\">\\(W_\\Phi\\)</span> 非空。单点无边框架是 GLFrame，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_m\">\\(\\bot_m\\)</span> 在其中为假，故可靠性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GL}\">\\(\\mathsf{GL}\\)</span> 不推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_m\">\\(\\bot_m\\)</span>。空假设一致，可在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 内扩张为极大一致子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Phi)\">\\(W_\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Phi)\\)</span> 给出基数界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi\">\\(R_\\Phi\\)</span> 非自反，因为它要求出现新方框公式；传递性由方框及内容的保持条件得到：若 wRvRu，w 的方框均在 v 再在 u，而 v 中新于 w 的方框在 u 中仍新于 w。有限传递非自反关系的每个非空子集有极大元，否则连续选后继得到重复点，由传递性违反非自反性。因此它是 GLFrame。</p>\n<p>极大一致性及 adequacy 给出三个命题性质：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_m\\notin w\">\\(\\bot_m\\notin w\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Phi\">\\(B\\in\\Phi\\)</span>，B 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(B)\">\\(c_m(B)\\)</span> 恰有一个在 w；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B\\to_m C)\\in\\Phi\">\\((B\\to_m C)\\in\\Phi\\)</span>，它属于 w 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\notin w\">\\(B\\notin w\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in w\">\\(C\\in w\\)</span>。证明均用有限 MP 推导及演绎定理：若两种互否公式都缺失，则它们都不可加入所得到的两条否定推导使 w 不一致；同时存在则直接推出假。蕴涵的正向是 MP 和一致性；反向由缺失 B 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(B)\">\\(c_m(B)\\)</span> 或已有 C 及命题重言式得到蕴涵。极大一致集对其可推出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 内公式闭合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(B)\">\\(c_m(B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_m B\">\\(\\neg_m B\\)</span> 的等价由双重否定重言式覆盖删否定的情形。</p>\n<p>现在对 B 的语法树归纳证明真值引理。原子由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\Phi\">\\(V_\\Phi\\)</span> 定义，假与蕴涵由上段三项性质和满足子句。若 □C 属于 w，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi\">\\(R_\\Phi\\)</span> 后继 v 含 C，归纳假设给出 v 满足 C，故 w 满足 □C。若 □C 不属于 w，用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f13b228413db1156\" href=\"?note=f13b228413db1156\" title=\"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor\">72-lem-gl-canonical-successor</a> 取后继 v 含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(C)\">\\(c_m(C)\\)</span>；上段互否性质使 C 不在 v，归纳假设使 C 在 v 为假，所以 □C 在 w 为假。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(C)\">\\(c_m(C)\\)</span> 的长度比 C 大，这一步也只对严格子式 C 使用归纳假设，没有循环归纳。</p>\n<p>若 GL 不证明 A，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{c_m(A)\\}\">\\(\\{c_m(A)\\}\\)</span> 一致，否则演绎定理及经典命题推理将给出 GL 证明 A。将此集合扩张到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{\\Phi_A}\">\\(W_{\\Phi_A}\\)</span> 中的 w，A 不属于 w；真值引理给出有限反模型。最后一式的正向是可靠性，反向用这个有限反模型。第一式的有限性、第二式的特定反模型和最后的双向完备性均已在本节逐项证明；没有将结论扩大到算术完备性、强完备性或无限前提的紧致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor","status":"resolved","id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"588ba1ca83000a13","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor","status":"resolved","id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 及其上游的 $\\mathcal F_m,\\Phi_A,\\operatorname{Adeq}_m,W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi$；$\\Phi$ 是任意有限 adequate set，$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"588ba1ca83000a13","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness]] 及其上游的 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$、$\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)$、$\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m B$ 和 $\\mathcal M\\models_m B$。关系仍按 $R(u,v)\\Leftrightarrow\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R$ 使用。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor","status":"resolved","id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"现在对 B 的语法树归纳证明真值引理。原子由 $V_\\Phi$ 定义，假与蕴涵由上段三项性质和满足子句。若 □C 属于 w，则每个 $R_\\Phi$ 后继 v 含 C，归纳假设给出 v 满足 C，故 w 满足 □C。若 □C 不属于 w，用 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 取后继 v 含 $c_m(C)$；上段互否性质使 C 不在 v，归纳假设使 C 在 v 为假，所以 □C 在 w 为假。即使 $c_m(C)$ 的长度比 C 大，这一步也只对严格子式 C 使用归纳假设，没有循环归纳。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m,\\Phi_A,\\operatorname{Adeq}_m,W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models_m B","display":false},{"tex":"R(u,v)\\Leftrightarrow\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi)\\ \\land\\ |W_\\Phi|\\leq2^{|\\Phi|}\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall w\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal M_\\Phi,w\\Vdash_m B\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in w\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\bigr)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists w\\in W_{\\Phi_A}\\;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal M_{\\Phi_A},w\\Vdash_m A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall W\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall V\\;\\bigl(&\n|W|<\\omega\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\\\\n&\\Rightarrow\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\models_m A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W_\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_m\\notin w","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(B)","display":false},{"tex":"(B\\to_m C)\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"B\\notin w","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in w","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_m B","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(C)","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{c_m(A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W_{\\Phi_A}","display":false}],"bytes":4345,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness|thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL](72-thm-gl-finite-completeness.md)"},{"id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是原书有限 adequate set 上的 L 典范构造，不能用全部极大一致集的通常无限典范模型代替。关系除了传递方框及其内容，还要求严格增加至少一个方框公式；这一额外条件给有限框架的非自反性。由于 $\\Phi$ 对子公式封闭，$\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi$。所有构造都由分离、幂集和有限集操作给出；$V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)$ 唯一确定。这里先定义三元组，不预先假定其非空性或真值引理；这些证明在 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 与 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 中给出。Remark 中这两条链接是后续导航，不是定义依赖。"},{"id":"c782a953a5846737","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；语法、代入、$\\top_m,\\bot_m$ 和保护谓词取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]。$A_i,B$ 由下式构造；使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 的有限模型语义。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-gl-finite-completeness|thm-gl-finite-completeness — Finite Kripke completeness of GL]]"},{"id":"5d05c1d542238d8c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$，代入及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i$ 取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 及有限模型完备性取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。"},{"id":"799dbc6630c443a3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi_A$ 与有限反模型界 $2^{|\\Phi_A|}$ 取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]；$\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]。"},{"id":"9eb88cb14d7f1646","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；语法及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]，有限模型完备性使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。"},{"id":"29eaaec90a48dc6c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-467","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["67a60f891de62bc0","a84520417d5eb9a3","91aa38d1fd431425","f13b228413db1156","588ba1ca83000a13"]}